<i>The sadness entangling me</i>

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:11.680
<i>which I can't quite carry will go away</i>

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:16.310
<i>At the end of the infinite journey</i>

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:22.480
<i>the present joins up with tomorrow</i>

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:25.030
To be continued...

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:25.030
To be continued...

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:32.280
Hey, Everett

00:22:32.280 --> 00:22:36.120
What am I {like }in your world?

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:38.920
Let me take a look

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:40.420
Hey, Everett

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:44.210
According to you, there are lots of different worlds

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:47.220
I'm not sure I understand

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:49.180
"Hi, Dandy"

00:22:50.390 --> 00:22:51.090
"Hello"

00:22:52.350 --> 00:22:53.180
"How are you doing?"

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:56.180
Hey, Ph.D.

00:22:56.180 --> 00:23:00.020
Your alternate worlds will always overlap and never interfere

00:23:00.020 --> 00:23:02.690
That blows my mind

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:08.860
Things get harder when they cool

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:12.870
Things melt when they're heated

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:15.080
This world is so full of rules,

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:18.750
it's going to drive me crazy

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:23.040
One dimension, two dimensions, three dimensions

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:27.010
A supernova is spreading from west to east

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:29.720
Easy game, easy game,

00:23:29.720 --> 00:23:31.180
too easy game

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:35.720
The way there is fine, but what about coming back?

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:40.640
A dream of a never-ending dream

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:44.980
A wonderful, milky kiss

00:23:45.610 --> 00:23:52.070
Will this universe expand forever?

00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:10.010
<b>Next time:
"A Race in Space is Dangerous, Baby."</b>
